            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This repository contains the scripts and data for replicating the results of :\n\"Hotspots in peril: Misalignment of conservation efforts and ecological values in a shallow coastal sea\"</p>\n\n<p>The repository contains an R-project with renv environment for version control of packages used in the script. Analysis were done in R version 4.3.1. </p>\n\n<p>The scripts folder contains all scripts for running the analysis, numbered in sequential order. </p>\n\n<p>The dependencies folder contains data files and rdata objects created during the analysis that are necessary for the analysis.</p>\n\n<p>The Waddenmozaiek benthos data is available through NIOZ (www.nioz.nl). The interaction matrix can be downloaded from 10.25850/nioz/7b.b.gg</p>\n\n<p>The ecotope map used in this study can be downloaded via https://maps.rijkswaterstaat.nl/gwproj55/index.html?viewer=Ecotopen</p>"
                },
                "dsDescriptionDate": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionDate",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "2024-02-22"
                }
              }
            ]
